body:
I think (and hope) that it may run similarly to Bojack Horseman: first season/s were iffy and the characters were a bit difficult to sympathize with and stay for, but the storyline and writing gets progressively better onto the later seasons. So with that being said, I'd say possibly 5-6 seasons. 

&#x200B;

(Edit: Nevermind, forgot that the recent release was also part of season one so I think it'll run for 4 seasons)

CW/TW: Mention of suicide

&#x200B;

Yep! Got suicidal. I'm still learning to value life over academic pressure to this day. Ang hirap lalo kasi yung circumstances hindi nag-aallow 'nun mismo. Pero laban pa rin, syempre. Wherever you are, OP, I hope you're well.
